ke sure you can swim before you go in the deep water, but when a picture of his late grandfather falls into the ocean, Shima jumps in after it without thinking. Nearly drowning as a result, he is instead saved by a very perfect stranger... one whose strangeness extends to only being human from the waist up!<br><br>\nFor Shima, who's always felt like a fish out of water himself, it's more than just a revelation, and the young man and merman quickly begin to bond in ways neither anticipated. And yet, it's going to be far from easy sailing. After all, Shima and Isaki aren't just from opposite sides of the tracks, they're from entirely divergent species, and swimming in separate gene pools may make maintaining a long term relationship a whole different kettle of fish!<br><br>\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)<br>", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 11}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 1, "duration": 30, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#konodan", "genres": ["Fantasy", "Romance"], "tags": [{"name": "Boys' Love", "rank": 94, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Mermaid", "rank": 86, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "LGBTQ+ Themes", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cute Boys Doing Cute Things", "rank": 66, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Slapstick", "rank": 30, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Tragedy", "rank": 26, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 15453, "title": {"romaji": "Shinryaku! Ika Musume: Kore ga Umi e no Ai Jana-ika!", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "MV bundled with the limited edition of the Invader Ika Musume album.", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 1}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 1}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Monster Girl", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 15505, "title": {"romaji": "Shining Hearts: Shiawase no Pan Specials", "english": null}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "The 6 short \"Chibi Style\" Specials on each of the Blu-rays/DVDs.", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 12}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 6, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Fantasy"], "tags": []}, {"id": 15533, "title": {"romaji": "Yakimochi Caprice", "english": null}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "Special ending animation sequence for the \"Anime Seijin: Tokimeki Recipe\" cooking and talk show. <br><br>\nThe \"nonsensical romantic fantasy\" of the anime centres around a kitten named Loup and a puppy named Noix &mdash; both of whom believe that they are actually human girls.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2011, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 4}, "season": "WINTER", "seasonYear": 2011, "episodes": 2, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Nekomimi", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Kemonomimi", "rank": 10, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 15535, "title": {"romaji": "Yumekuri", "english": null}, "format": "OVA", "description": "The story revolves around Yukami Makoto, a high school boy whose hobby is visiting hot springs. His 100th hot spring visit is at Miyama-kan, an inn run by four poster girls: Tokura, Akino, Tsutsuji and Mitomo. There, Makoto spies Yuri, a goddess of the hot springs, and unexpectedly usurps her powers. Makoto ends up working at the inn.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 11}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 1, "duration": 6, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Supernatural"], "tags": [{"name": "Seinen", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 15653, "title": {"romaji": "Stay the same", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "The music video was bundled with the limited first edition of Kuraki Mai's 10th album, Over the Rainbow. The song is part of the Uta no Kotoba (Words of Songs) collaborative project between Sanrio's Wish me mell characters and Kuraki Mai.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 1}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 1}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Kids", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 15657, "title": {"romaji": "Yuke! Shouei-kun", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "The series is inspired by the Super Sentai actor Shouei (&#29031;&#33521;). Shouei is best known for his role as Gouki/GingaBlue in Seijuu Sentai Gingaman, a role he has reprised for other Super Sentai series and films.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 2}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 3}, "season": "WINTER", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 6, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 15673, "title": {"romaji": "Tell Your World", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video from livetune under the label Toy's Factory.<br><br>\nTell Your World is the theme song used in the Google Chrome commercial of Google Japan.", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 3}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 3}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Vocal Synth", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Idol", "rank": 20, "i