sshapon is shaped like Bandai's Gashapon prize-dispensing machines.) The Gasshapon was sent to the past by the future Shouta, from an era in which an alien group called CC (or Cold Cosmo) have made it their mission to change all stars and planets that have light and warmth into dark, cold places like their own. The Gasshapon had intended to take young Shouta to 2080 to save the future, but because time travel had not been fully perfected yet, Shouta is thrown into a completely different time, the era of the Honnouji Incident (1582), where Shouta actually becomes the famous warlord Oda Nobunaga.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)\n<br>\n<br>\nThe ONA series project got canceled. The one minute promotional video is what's left of it.", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 10, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "VIDEO_GAME", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Historical", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 15979, "title": {"romaji": "Eureka Seven AO: Aratanari Fukaki Ao", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "A short anime series that describes the everyday life of Ao and other Eureka Seven Ao characters.", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 10, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Slice of Life"], "tags": []}, {"id": 15993, "title": {"romaji": "Ginga e Kickoff!!: Natsuyasumi Special", "english": null}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "Clip show with soccer commentators providing commentary. <br>", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 8}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 1, "duration": 28, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Sports"], "tags": [{"name": "Football", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 16001, "title": {"romaji": "Kokoro Connect: Michi Random", "english": "Kokoro Connect ~ The OVAs"}, "format": "OVA", "description": "They've already had their bodies swapped like musical chairs, had their ages changed at random and experienced their deepest desires taking control of them without warning, but if you thought Heartseed was finished with Taichi, Iori, Himeko, Yoshifumi and Yui, you've got another thing coming! Now there's a new affliction going around, and the name of this peculiar bug is emotion sickness. As in, suddenly your emotions jump out of your body and sick someone else! Needless to say, that's more than simply awkward if you've got a deep rooted phobia like a fear of men or repressed emotions that you've been trying to keep hidden, but in some situations it can literally be deadly! What is Heartseed up to this time, and why is he making our heroes involuntarily share their innermost dirty laundry?<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 4, "duration": 27, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "LIGHT_NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Drama", "Romance", "Slice of Life", "Supernatural"], "tags": [{"name": "School", "rank": 83, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Female Cast", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Coming of Age", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Body Swapping", "rank": 75, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Love Triangle", "rank": 70, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Tsundere", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ensemble Cast", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Heterosexual", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Bullying", "rank": 55, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Philosophy", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 16033, "title": {"romaji": "Karneval", "english": null}, "format": "OVA", "description": "DVD bundled with the limited edition of the 10th volume of the manga, previewing the upcoming TV anime and including footage that will not be used in the series.", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 10}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 1, "duration": 5, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Fantasy", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Josei", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 16183, "title": {"romaji": "Lupin Shanshei", "english": "LUPIN THE THIIIRRRD"}, "format": "OVA", "description": "For some reason, a 100-foot-tall Lupin is stomping around?! These hilarious animated shorts parody the smash-hit series featuring everyone’s favorite master thief, Lupin III! A collaboration with Flash animator FROGMAN, known for his quirky, comedic works.", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 10, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": [{"name": "Parody", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 16233, "title": {"romaji": "Yowai Mushi", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Another clip from Tekken, denouncing the intimidation experienced by certain Japanese.", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 11}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Drama", "Music"], "tags": [{"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Bullying", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Work", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Family Life", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 16239, "title": {"romaji": "ONE PIECE: Episode of Luffy - Hand Island no Bouken", "english": "One Piece: Episode of Luffy - Hand Island Adventure"}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "The story of the Hand Island no Bouken special is set a little before the events of One Piece Film Z and depicts a major \"Hand Island\" incident during the New World storyline. The story is set at \"Cannon Town\" where a parent and a child work as craftspeople. The incident revolves around them and a commodore of a marine base. The special will also have a flashback scene to the story in the first chapter of the manga, but with new animation. <br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 1, "duration": 102, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Comedy", "Fantasy"], "tags": [{"name": "Shounen", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Super Power", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Pirates", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Military", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Estranged Family", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Male Cast", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ships", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 16273, "title": {"romaji": "Acchi Kocchi: PLACE=PRINCESS", "english": "Place to Place OVA"}, "format": "OVA", "description": "Unaired episode 13 of Acchi Kocchi that was included in Vol.6.", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 11}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 1, "duration": 23, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Romance", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "School", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Kuudere", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Seinen", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 16331, "title": {"romaji": "NEXT A-Class", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "In the not so distant future, to cope with the traffic jams and verticalization due to the increased population, the city of Tokyo was reconstructed under the theme of city sharing in which people share the urbane space by transforming the roads and city structure by time of the day. A woman named Nico is walking in the city. She is having her long-awaited day off; however, she does not know what to do and who to hang out with. She hopes an exciting thing suddenly happens.<br><br>\nThen, a truck passes right before her eyes. The loud music and flashy decoration of the vehicle reminds Nico the car it that everyone's talking about on the internet. As soon as Nico sees it, she runs after it, then runs into Gatsu and Makito. Nico gets in their latest A-Class and they chase after the truck driving through the city that is changing its form rapidly.<br><br>\n(Source: AniDB)", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 11}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 1, "duration": 6, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Advertisement", "rank": 80, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cars", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Urban", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Food", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cyberpunk", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ensemble Cast", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Male Cast", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 16468, "title": {"romaji": "ONE PIECE FILM: Z - GLORIOUS ISLAND", "english": null}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "An exclusive anime prologue to One Piece Film Z with an original story penned by manga creator Eiichiro Oda. <br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 2012, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2012, "episodes": 2, "d